            "image": "shopify://shop_images/earring.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Diamond stud earrings",
            "title_url": "https://daywdd.myshopify.com/collections/earrings",
            "description": "<p>Diamond studs are the jewelry equivalent of a little black dress - chic, timeless, and perfect for every occasion. Not only do these beautiful earrings instantly make any outfit look incredibly elegant, but they also light up your face and eyes, making diamond studs some of the most flattering accessories there are.</p><p>Their minimalist design allows for numerous variations, so you can choose between a range of different precious metals, diamond sizes and cuts, and even unique designs - such as <a href=\"https://daywdd.myshopify.com/collections/earrings\" title=\"https://daywdd.myshopify.com/collections/earrings\">diamond halos, clusters, heart-shaped</a> studs, and much more.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_4GdjVN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/brace.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Tennis bracelets",
            "title_url": "https://daywdd.myshopify.com/collections/bracelets",
            "description": "<p>Arguably the most iconic bracelet design in the entire world, the tennis bracelet is one of the most versatile pieces to have in your jewelry collection. You can wear tennis bracelets with everything from jeans to gowns, and they can be paired with every single piece in your jewelry box.</p><p>That’s what makes <a href=\"https://daywdd.myshopify.com/collections/bracelets\" title=\"https://daywdd.myshopify.com/collections/bracelets\">tennis bracelets</a> truly must-have pieces: their versatility. You can wear them by themselves, as the statement piece of a stack, or paired with your favorite watch. The possibilities are endless!</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_f3BcGq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/rings.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Stackable rings",
            "title_url": "shopify://collections/fashion-rings",
            "description": "<p>Whether you love minimalist jewelry or you’re all about statement pieces, stackable rings are for you. That’s because these delicate rings look great whether you prefer to wear one at a time or you decide to create a bold stack.</p><p>The best thing about stackable rings is that you have endless design options to choose from - not to mention, infinite combination possibilities. Stackable bands allow you to use your creativity as you mix and match different metal shades, designs, and ring widths. The sky’s the limit!</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_MByMT9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/hoops.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Diamond hoops and huggies",
            "title_url": "shopify://collections/earrings",
            "description": "<p>Hoop earrings, and their daintier version, huggies, instantly elevate any outfit. You can wear a pair of diamond huggies for a delicate everyday look, stack diamond hoops and huggies for the ultimate fashion statement, or pair diamond hoops with plain huggies for a stylish high-low effect.<br/><br/>No matter how you prefer to style them, you can never go wrong with these earrings. Hoops and huggies are perfect accessories to wear both as everyday pieces or to dress up on special occasions, so you’ll definitely be reaching for them all the time!<br/><br/></p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_n87LnF": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/necklace.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Initial pendant necklaces",
            "title_url": "shopify://collections/necklaces",
            "description": "<p>Pendants are the perfect way for you to express yourself through your jewelry. They’re personal pieces which you get to keep close to your heart - and that’s exactly what makes initial necklaces so timeless: they’re meaningful.<br/><br/>Whether you opt for your own initial or that of a loved one, initial necklaces never go out of style because personal jewelry is always in. So, go ahead and tell your story with your own unique initial necklaces that carry special meaning.<br/><br/></p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_wHT8MN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/chain.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Chain bracelets",
            "title_url": "shopify://collections/bracelets",
            "description": "<p>From delicate chains to bold links, these bracelets are the perfect staple pieces to have in your jewelry box. If you’re looking for bracelets which you can wear every day for an effortlessly stylish look, then chain bracelets are just what you need.<br/><br/>Yellow gold chains are particularly in vogue this season, but white and rose gold are just as stunning choices. Better yet, create a unique stack by mixing and matching chain links of different widths in all three shades of gold. Now, that’s a fashion statement that will have you turning heads everywhere.<br/><br/></p>",
            "content_width": 50
